    <bpmn:process id="W_W623" name="W623. Cross-Functional New Store Opening Readiness Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New store construction reaches 80% completion milestone (per W225/W227)
Frequency: Per new store; ~10–15 new stores/year
Volume: 1 readiness review per new store
Owner: VP Store Operations
Participants: VP Store Operations, IT Manager, HR Coordinator, Merchandising Coordinator, Finance Analyst, Supply Planner, Facilities Coordinator, Regional Manager, new Store Manager
Source: workflow W623 — Cross-Functional New Store Opening Readiness Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W623_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W623_Lane1" name="Engineering Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W623_Lane2" name="Department Heads">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W623_Lane3" name="VP Store Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W623_Lane4" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W623_End16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W623_Start6" name="New store construction reaches 80% completion milestone (per W225/W227)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task7" name="Engineering team confirms 80% construction completion (per W227); triggers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Engineering team confirms 80% construction completion (per W227); triggers readiness review process; VP Store Operations schedules readiness review meeting (T-30 days before target opening)
Responsible (R): Engineering Lead
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task8" name="IT">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Each department completes readiness checklist on shared project dashboard: (a) IT: network installed, POS terminals configured, RF devices ready, CCTV operational, WiFi tested, ERP access provisioned (per W152), (b) HR: Store Manager hired and trained, all positions filled or in final interview, payroll entity configured, biometric system installed, (c) Merchandising: initial stock order placed (per W2), planogram loaded, shelf labels printed, promotional materials prepared, (d) Finance: GL cost center created, bank deposit account opened, petty cash fund released, LGU business permit secured (per W54), BIR registration complete (per W485), (e) Supply Chain: first replenishment delivery scheduled, DC-to-store route confirmed, receiving area prepared, (f) Facilities: utilities connected, safety equipment installed, signage erected, parking lot completed
Responsible (R): Department Heads
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 4 hours (each)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task9" name="VP Store Operations conducts on-site readiness inspection: verifies physical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Store Operations conducts on-site readiness inspection: verifies physical construction completion, fixture installation, signage, safety equipment, receiving dock, customer areas, and backroom; documents findings with photos
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task10" name="Readiness review meeting (all stakeholders): each department presents readiness…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Readiness review meeting (all stakeholders): each department presents readiness status (Green/Yellow/Red); VP Store Operations compiles overall readiness scorecard; critical Red items assigned owners and resolution deadlines before opening
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task11" name="Go/No-Go decision: COO approves opening date if (a) all critical items are…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Go/No-Go decision: COO approves opening date if (a) all critical items are Green, (b) no more than 3 Yellow items remain, (c) no Red items are safety or compliance related; if criteria not met, opening delayed with revised target date
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task12" name="T-14 days: VP Store Operations conducts follow-up review on all Yellow items…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: T-14 days: VP Store Operations conducts follow-up review on all Yellow items; confirms resolution or escalates to COO; new Store Manager begins on-site for pre-opening preparation (per W16)
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task13" name="T-7 days: soft opening rehearsal — conduct full store operations simulation for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: T-7 days: soft opening rehearsal — conduct full store operations simulation for 1 day: POS transactions, inventory receiving, customer service scenarios, emergency procedures; identify and resolve operational issues before public opening
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): Regional Manager
Duration: 8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task14" name="T-0: Grand opening; VP Store Operations and Regional Manager on-site for first…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: T-0: Grand opening; VP Store Operations and Regional Manager on-site for first 3 days; daily check-in calls for first 2 weeks; formal 30-day review per W16
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W623_Task15" name="Post-opening (T+30): VP Store Operations conducts 30-day review — sales vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Post-opening (T+30): VP Store Operations conducts 30-day review — sales vs. plan, operational issues, customer feedback (per W608), staffing adequacy, system stability; documents lessons learned for next store opening
Responsible (R): VP Store Operations
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W623_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W623_End16" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W623_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W623_Annotation17">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-243 (ensure controlled execution — Demand Forecasting &amp; S&amp;OP (PA-02.1).) | - operational: 80% trigger point and T-14 follow-up allowing 2-week contingency; operational: shared project dashboard with dependency visualization; operational: phased delivery schedule and temporary security arrangements
Owner: VP Store Operations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W623_Assoc18" sourceRef="W623_Annotation17" targetRef="W623_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow19" sourceRef="W623_Start6" targetRef="W623_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow20" sourceRef="W623_Task7" targetRef="W623_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow21" sourceRef="W623_Task8" targetRef="W623_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow22" sourceRef="W623_Task9" targetRef="W623_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow23" sourceRef="W623_Task10" targetRef="W623_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow24" sourceRef="W623_Task11" targetRef="W623_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow25" sourceRef="W623_Task12" targetRef="W623_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow26" sourceRef="W623_Task13" targetRef="W623_Task14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow27" sourceRef="W623_Task14" targetRef="W623_Task15" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W623_Flow28" sourceRef="W623_Task15" targetRef="W623_End16" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W623_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W623_plane" bpmnElement="W_W623">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W623_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W623_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="2210" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W623_Lane2_di" bpmnElement="W623_Lane2" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="250" width="2210" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W623_Lane3_di" bpmnElement="W623_Lane3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="420" width="2210" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
