    <bpmn:process id="W_W1355" name="W1355. Typhoon &amp; Natural Disaster Demand Surge Forecasting &amp; Pre-Positioning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PAGASA tropical cyclone advisory (Signal 1 or above); or DENR flood advisory for a region containing BuildRight stores/DCs
Frequency: 15–20 typhoon events/year affecting Philippine landmass; ~8–12 events directly impact BuildRight store/DC regions
Volume: Each event potentially affects 20–80 stores depending on typhoon path; pre-positioning involves 50–200 SKUs per affected region
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Supply Planning Manager, DC Operations Manager, Logistics Planner, Category Manager
Source: workflow W1355 — Typhoon &amp; Natural Disaster Demand Surge Forecasting &amp; Pre-Positioning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1355_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1355_Lane1" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1355_Lane2" name="Supply Planning Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1355_Lane3" name="Logistics Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1355_Lane4" name="DC Operations Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1355_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1355_Start6" name="PAGASA tropical cyclone advisory (Signal 1 or above); or DENR flood advisory for a region…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1355_Task7" name="Merchandise Planner monitors PAGASA weather bulletins and receives automated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner monitors PAGASA weather bulletins and receives automated alert when tropical cyclone enters Philippine Area of Responsibility (PAR)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Continuous during typhoon season</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task8" name="When cyclone projected to make landfall near BuildRight regions: Planner…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: When cyclone projected to make landfall near BuildRight regions: Planner activates typhoon demand model for affected DC zones — calculates expected demand surge for 50–200 disaster-response SKUs based on historical typhoon sales data × cyclone intensity × population density of affected area
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Supply Planning Manager
Duration: 2–3 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task9" name="Planner generates pre-positioning recommendation: additional stock transfer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Planner generates pre-positioning recommendation: additional stock transfer quantities from unaffected DCs to at-risk DCs; prioritizes high-velocity items (tarps, nails, waterproofing) for immediate deployment
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Supply Planning Manager
Duration: 2 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task10" name="Supply Planning Manager reviews and approves pre-positioning plan; authorizes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Supply Planning Manager reviews and approves pre-positioning plan; authorizes emergency replenishment POs for items where DC stock is insufficient
Responsible (R): Supply Planning Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 hour/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task11" name="Logistics Planner arranges expedited inter-DC transfers and emergency vendor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Logistics Planner arranges expedited inter-DC transfers and emergency vendor deliveries; bypasses normal 2–3 day lead time for priority shipments
Responsible (R): Logistics Planner
Accountable (A): DC Operations Manager
Duration: 3–4 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task12" name="DC Operations Manager confirms receipt of pre-positioned stock; allocates…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: DC Operations Manager confirms receipt of pre-positioned stock; allocates staging area for rapid outbound dispatch once typhoon passes
Responsible (R): DC Operations Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1355_Task13" name="Post-event: Merchandise Planner conducts after-action analysis comparing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Post-event: Merchandise Planner conducts after-action analysis comparing forecasted vs. actual demand by SKU and region; feeds learnings back into typhoon demand model
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Supply Planning Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1355_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1355_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1355_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1355_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-172 (ensure demand-plan integrity &amp; replenishment authorization.) | - operational: Merchandise Planner review and approval gate
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
