        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-243 (ensure controlled execution — Demand Forecasting &amp; S&amp;OP (PA-02.1).) | - operational: Merchandise Planner review and approval gate
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
